    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "COMING SOON\r\n\r\nEnquire Today for an Exclusive Pre-Market Viewing\r\n\r\nDixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present Grangemount to the market — an exceptional four-bedroom, two-bathroom family residence set on beautifully maintained grounds, complete with a self-contained accommodation unit to the rear.\r\n\r\nNestled on the northern edge of Fingal, close to the Meath border, this impressive home enjoys a tranquil countryside setting in the picturesque and highly sought-after village of The Naul. Offering an ideal balance of privacy, space, and convenience, Grangemount is perfectly suited to growing families seeking a peaceful lifestyle without compromising on accessibility.\r\n\r\nThe Naul is renowned for its strong sense of community and excellent local amenities, including shops, cafés, and the acclaimed Seamus Ennis Arts Centre, a vibrant cultural venue hosting concerts, theatre productions, exhibitions, workshops, comedy events, and seasonal markets throughout the year.\r\n\r\nFor sporting enthusiasts, the area offers an abundance of recreational opportunities, including local GAA, soccer, rugby, cricket, and golf clubs, all within easy reach. Families are further catered for by a selection of well-regarded primary schools in The Naul and surrounding villages, while a number of secondary schools are conveniently located in nearby Gormanston and Balbriggan.\r\n\r\nDespite its idyllic rural setting, Grangemount benefits from exceptional connectivity. The M1 motorway is just minutes away, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport, the M50 motorway, and the country’s major transport routes.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, extensive grounds, versatile ancillary living space, and a highly desirable location, Grangemount represents a rare opportunity to acquire a distinguished family home in one of North County Dublin’s most charming countryside settings.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. To register your interest and arrange an exclusive pre-market viewing, please contact Dixon Residential Estate Agents.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: While every effort has been made to ensure the accuracy of the information contained herein, details may have been provided by the vendor. Dixon Residential Estate Agents accepts no responsibility for any errors or omissions and advises all prospective purchasers to satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of the information through their own independent enquiries and professional advisors."
      },
